<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8395" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνεπί-κρῐτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>not decided, indeterminate,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πράγματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aristocl.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Eus.
				<u>PE</u>
				14.18
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>P.</u>
				1.98
			</span></i>, etc. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>M.</u>
					11.230
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>indistinct, indeterminate,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φαντασία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plot.
					3.6.4
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> Medic.,
				<i>untested, untried,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ διαφωνία ἡ ἀ.,</span> t.t. of the
			Empirics, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				1.78
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>not officially examined,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				POxy.
				257.23
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>, etc.; of a question, etc., <i>unexamined,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Simp.
				<u>in Ph.</u>
				1148.29
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
